<b>One Piece</b>

3
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.250
<b>Wano Arc</b>

4
00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:48.930
You should go sightsee elsewhere

5
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.380
<b>Tsuru Returns the Favor</b>

6
00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:52.880
you are aware of who controls
this country, I presume

7
00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.260
[HAWKINS PIRATES CHUCKLE]
It look like I give
a crap It's Kaido, right

8
00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:03.980
Tell him we're here to take down
an Emperor Dial it back, Luffy

9
00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.730
