10
00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.860
[GASPS]
Oh, I was just kidding! Sorry

11
00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.290
[HAWKINS PIRATES]
Huh

12
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.420
[HAWKINS]
Let's see what
the cards have to say about

13
00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.880
