You don't even know how to use
it Now hand it over, C'mon

19
00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.160
Kill them

20
00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:07.460
[HAWKINS PIRATES YELL]

21
00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.890
Let's see what this thing can do

22
00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.980
Don't throw the scabbard, Luffy

23
00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:17.310
[LUFFY YELLS]

24
00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:21.770
Gum Pistol

25
00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:26.410
[GASPS]
You're not using it right

26
00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:34.090
[GASPS]
Even the lizard's fighting me

27
00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:38.840
[GASPS]
Hey, knock it off

28
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.720
[YELLS]

29
00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.890
Straw Sword

30
00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:13.630
His sword's creepy!
I feel bad for the lizard

31
00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.760
Observe. That's Minus One Life

32
00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:40.070
[HAWKINS]
You seem confused These Strawmen each
represent the lives of my subordinates

33
00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:49.370
With my Straw powers I can
infuse my body with their spirits

34
00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:55.750
They take damage for me If I amass
ten souls, I can die ten times

35
00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:17.240
[HAWKINS]
Now, let's play a game, shall we A game

36
00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.930
I'm not so bold as to challenge two
members of the Worst Generation at once

37
00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.030
At least not in a fair fight that is

38
00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:40.330
He's a bigger pain in the ass then
he looks Heh. I shoulda expected it

39
00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:50.060
Now let us begin

40
00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.400
[HAWKINS]
Drat. This card
represents internal discord

41
00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.030
